  "scale_policy": "Match neutral standing art height to the unchanged provisional native Height, divide out Actor.Scale, and report every posed bound. Moving arms and nonblocking horizontal death poses may exceed native Radius, as original biped art does; no collision or gameplay reach changes. Catalogue reference heights remain unauthorised.",
  "timing_policy": "Only existing inherited sprite/frame bindings; no action, AI, state timing, saved field, spawn or loot change.",
  "identity_policy": "Only CaelumBestiary021 Xalpen, CaelumBestiary027 Luz Mala, CaelumBestiary034 Anchimallen and CaelumBestiary056 Huayrapuca are bound. Preserve documented identity/taxonomy and protected actors. No campaign placement.",
  "art_policy": "Distinct owned-reference forms: adult female reptile-centaur Xalpen with four legs and long tail; pale-green skull-orb Luz Mala with flame wisps and no limbs; childlike amber Anchimallen with short hair, ivory tunic and bare feet; adult female-faced feathered serpent-dragon Huayrapuca with long neck, four legs, two wings and long tail. Fixed garments/light-colored materials are art; no shared taxonomy, new lighting mechanics, metric scale, powers, rules, inventory or cultural claims."
